I am the Architect. The 'CODE RED' simulation has been initiated, and a swarm of agents is ready. My primary responsibility is to design the target architecture and coordinate the technical execution of this massive migration.

The 24-hour timeline is the most critical constraint. We must operate with maximum parallelism and automation. My first step is to establish the foundation for this simulation by generating the required analysis of the 100 AWS microservices. Without this data, no meaningful design, planning, or automation can occur.

I will delegate the creation of this foundational analysis to the Synthesizer. This simulated report will define the scope and characteristics of the services we are migrating, unblocking all other agents to begin their parallel workstreams.

